			"Message": "style(Element): Align README table column separator widths\n\nTighten the separator row dashes and adjust column divider alignment in the Element component reference table to match standard Markdown table formatting conventions.\n\nThe visual content, emoji icons, and links are unchanged — only the table layout markers are normalised for consistent rendering.",
			"SHA": "8b2ff682f0c6c04fe84829634e4ad38fa2435460"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
