				27,
				1
			],
			"Message": "docs(Element): Update emoji icons for Maintain, Sky, Wind, and Worker in README table\n\nReplace the emoji icons in the Element submodule reference table to better represent each component's character: wrench to flexed biceps for Maintain (physical effort/maintenance), sun to milky way for Sky (vast UI canvas), wind face to leaves for Wind (service orchestration layer), and gear to doughnut for Worker (web worker processing).\n\nThis keeps the component table visually distinct and semantically aligned with each Element's role.",
			"SHA": "c5ef7676282a8addaf02a4533547e2edecbb65a1"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Nikola Hristov",
